The reporting agent did not survive, which fits having 0 cells. If it had taken cells early, the reserve would have been lower than 6. Taking would also have prevented the generator from running if it had chosen take instead of operate. The reserve rising by exactly 2 requires that the reporting agent operated. It could have operated and also taken only if a single action allowed both, which it doesn't. So there is no evidence of a violation.

